section -- merged from Development.AbelianVarietyTheory.Proofs.DegenerationProofs.ExistsUniqueCombOfIndependentSpecialFibre
open CategoryTheory Limits MonoidalCategory CartesianMonoidalCategory MonObj AlgebraicGeometry
